repository-code: https://github.com/omip-project/omip

url: https://github.com/omip-project/omip

abstract: >
  Open Mission Intelligence Platform (OMIP) is an open-source mission
  data infrastructure for autonomous systems supporting UGV, UAV,
  AUV and USV applications. It provides mission management,
  telemetry acquisition, MQTT integration, replay,
  environment modelling and research-oriented data analytics.

keywords:
